Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:17:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] chore(kanban): clear the code-health blockers of the
 wake-reason branch [daveey]

- kanban_placement_forward hold/recover: the three catch-alls are deliberate never-run-here boundaries; each
  now logs the traceback (logger.exception) instead of a bare print.
- kanban_chat_links.replica_cards: the published-wait conditions move into _ledger_wait (CC back to 20).
- kanban_session_activity: _park_of and _remote_wait move to kanban_session_activity_remote_wait (re-exported).
- tests: the schedule park test moves to test_kanban_db_schedule.py; the forwarder recovery tests this branch
  added move to test_kanban_placement_recover.py.

scripts.code_health against main: 0 blocking, 0 advisory.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
